.TH CUSTODIO 1 "" "custodio" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
custodio \- import a PKCS#12 key into the custodio signing service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B custodio import
[\fB\-\-id\fR \fIkey id\fR]
.I file.p12
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B custodio
is the command-line importer of the custodio signing service.
.B import
reads a PKCS#12 file and stores its key where the service keeps keys.
The file password is asked on the terminal.
It is never taken from the arguments or from the environment.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-id " key id"
Name the stored key
.IR "key id" .
